{"id":56566,"mal_id":56566,"title":"Beyblade X","englishTitle":"Beyblade X","title_english":"Beyblade X","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Beyblade X","ja":"ベイブレードエックス"},"synopsis":"At the heart of X City stands the impressive X Tower, an interconnected twin-skyscraper structure that symbolizes the pinnacle of every Beyblade player's dream. The building serves as the official headquarters for professional Beybattles, where competitors strive to ascend all one hundred floors; at its summit, the reigning champions, Team Pendragon, await contenders worthy of challenging their title.\n\nBird Kazami, an amateur Blader, arrives in the city eager to turn professional. However, he and his teammates are crushed in their first qualifying match, prompting his companions to give up and disband their team. Fortunately, Bird is soon approached by the easygoing Ekusu Kurosu. In disguise as \"Kamen X\" to hide his identity as a former member of the undefeated Team Pendragon, Ekusu wants to climb the tower all over again. To complete their new group, they recruit skilled Beyblade expert and savvy social media influencer Multi Nanairo.\n\nDriven by their individual goals, the trio wins their preliminary rounds, launching their careers as Team Persona. Bird and his new friends must navigate the world of corporate sponsorships, earn the fickle public's support, and defeat many formidable opponents—all in their quest to reach X Tower's peak.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"En el corazón de X City se encuentra la impresionante Torre X, una estructura de rascacielos gemelos interconectados que simboliza el pináculo del sueño de todo jugador de Beyblade. El edificio sirve como sede oficial de Beybattles profesionales, donde los competidores se esfuerzan por ascender los cien pisos; En su cima, los actuales campeones, el Equipo Pendragon, esperan contendientes dignos de desafiar su título.\n\nBird Kazami, un Blader aficionado, llega a la ciudad deseoso de convertirse en profesional. Sin embargo, él y sus compañeros son aplastados en su primer partido de clasificación, lo que llevó a sus compañeros a rendirse y disolver su equipo. Afortunadamente, el tranquilo Ekusu Kurosu pronto se acerca a Bird. Disfrazado de \"Kamen X\" para ocultar su identidad como ex miembro del invicto Equipo Pendragon, Ekusu quiere volver a subir a la torre. Para completar su nuevo grupo, reclutan al experto en Beyblade y al influyente experto en redes sociales Multi Nanairo.\n\nImpulsados ​​por sus objetivos individuales, el trío gana sus rondas preliminares, lanzando sus carreras como Team Persona. Bird y sus nuevos amigos deben navegar por el mundo de los patrocinios corporativos, ganarse el apoyo del público voluble y derrotar a muchos oponentes formidables, todo en su búsqueda por alcanzar la cima de la Torre X.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"currently_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1465,"average_episode_duration":1465,"startDate":"2023-10-06","start_date":"2023-10-06","endDate":null,"end_date":null,"season":"fall","year":2023,"start_season":{"year":2023,"season":"fall"},"episodes":null,"num_episodes":null,"score":6.83,"mean":6.83,"numListUsers":7988,"num_list_users":7988,"genres":[{"id":2,"name":"Adventure"},{"id":15,"name":"Kids"},{"id":30,"name":"Sports"}],"studios":[{"id":28,"name":"OLM"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/qAq9RBeHZoTMDFqQZ2o4cE5CJIQ.jpg","logo_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sC8VGgUi1KSJpx9TjAWj8Z3Ee1A.png","tmdb_id":"226688","tmdb_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:49:39.151Z","images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/145458.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/145458l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/145458.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/145458l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimel